# ---- Server-only secrets — DO NOT prefix with VITE_ and DO NOT commit --------
# Set these as Supabase Edge Function secrets:
#   supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=your_google_ai_studio_key
# (SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are auto-injected into deployed
#  Edge Functions by Supabase — you do not set them manually.)
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key       # Gemini generates end-of-session summaries
#
# ---- Local seed script only (never imported by the app) ---------------------
# Export these in your shell before running `npm run seed`:
#   SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=<your-service-role-key>
